{"lang":"ar","dir":"rtl","title":"C&#39;s Cuts | صالون حلاقة في فيرفيلد، كاليفورنيا: فيد وتدريج وتحديد","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">انتقل إلى المحتوى</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C&#39;s</span><span>C&#39;s Cuts</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">من نحن</a><a href=\"#services\">الخدمات</a><a href=\"#faq\">الأسئلة الشائعة</a><a href=\"#gallery\">الصور</a><a href=\"#reviews\">التقييمات</a><a href=\"#visit\">المواعيد والموقع</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"اللغة\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" selected>العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\">اتصل</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/storefront.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">صالون حلاقة · فيرفيلد، كاليفورنيا · منذ 2010</p>\n    <h1>C&#39;s Cuts</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">فيد نظيف، وتحديد حاد، وحلاقون لا يستعجلون. صالون الحي في فيرفيلد منذ 2010.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.8 · 135 تقييم على Google<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> اتصل لتحجز دورك</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=C&#39;s%20Cuts%2C%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%2C%20Fairfield%2C%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> الاتجاهات</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li>منذ 2010</li><li>نرحّب بالحضور بدون موعد</li><li>نقدًا أو Zelle</li><li>قصّات الأطفال</li><li>موقف سيارات خاص</li><li>مهيّأ للكراسي المتحركة</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">الصالون</p><h2>بلا استعجال. فقط قصّة رائعة.</h2><p>يقصّ C&#39;s Cuts (المعروف أيضًا باسم C&#39;s Barber Shop) الشعر في North Texas Street منذ 2010. تخصصاتنا القصّات الجديدة والتدريج والفيد وقصّات الكرو والتهذيب والتحديد بالموس.</p><p>Chris وChristine وبقية فريقنا لا نستعجل، ونهتم بالتفاصيل، والحديث معنا سهل. وكثير من الآباء والأمهات يحضرون أطفالهم أيضًا.</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.8★</b><span>135 تقييمًا</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>بدون موعد</b><span>أهلًا بك</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>2010</b><span>تأسس</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/fade-cut.jpg\" alt=\"فيد جديد في C&#39;s Cuts\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">على الكرسي</p><h2>القصّات والخدمات</h2><p>تخصصاتنا. اطلب من حلاقك أي قصّة تريدها.</p></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>قصّات جديدة</h3></div><p>قصّتك المعتادة، مرتّبة ومشكّلة كما تحب.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>فيد</h3></div><p>فيد منخفض ومتوسط وعالٍ وحتى الصلع، بتدرّج نظيف.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>تدريج</h3></div><p>تدريج نظيف عند الرقبة والصدغين.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>قصّة كرو</h3></div><p>قصيرة وكلاسيكية وسهلة العناية.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>تهذيب</h3></div><p>حافظ على الطول ورتّب كل شيء.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>تحديد بالموس</h3></div><p>حواف حادة بلمسة نهائية بالموس.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>قصّات الأطفال</h3></div><p>حلاقون صبورون مع الصغار (ومع الأهل الصعبين).</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">لا ننشر الأسعار على الإنترنت. اتصل على ‎(707) 673-7601 لمعرفة الأسعار الحالية. الدفع: نقدًا أو Zelle فقط.</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">معلومات مفيدة</p><h2>قبل أن تأتي</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>نرحّب بالحضور بدون موعد</b></li><li><b>نقدًا أو Zelle</b><span>لا نقبل بطاقات الائتمان</span></li><li><b>موقف سيارات خاص</b><span>موقف بعيد عن الشارع ومضاء، بمدخلين أمامي وخلفي</span></li><li><b>موقف للدراجات</b></li><li><b>مهيّأ للكراسي المتحركة</b></li><li><b>قصّات الأطفال</b><span>كثير من الأهل يحضرون أطفالهم</span></li><li><b>تأسس عام 2010</b></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">معرض الصور</p><h2>من الصالون</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/fade-cut.jpg\" alt=\"سكن فيد مع تحديد حاد\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/textured-cut.jpg\" alt=\"فيد مع شعر أطول ومموّج في الأعلى\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/storefront.jpg\" alt=\"واجهة C&#39;s Cuts في 2240 N Texas St\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/storefront-2.jpg\" alt=\"مدخل C&#39;s Cuts مع عمود الحلاق\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">التقييمات</p><h2>الكرسي المفضّل في فيرفيلد</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.8</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 135 تقييم</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">اقرأ المزيد من التقييمات على Google ←</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.5</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 34 تقييم</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">اقرأ المزيد من التقييمات على Yelp ←</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Woke up this morning took a quick glance in the mirror; and thought to myself &quot;Dam C!!!! you did a great job on the haircut....Thnx Bro!!&quot; Cya on the nxt1”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Best haircut I’ve had in my two years in Cali and I’ll definitely be here every month. I recommend this shop to anyone who wants a legit cut for a legit price (don’t forget to tip). They make sure you’re not looking in the mirror afterwards wondering why you still go to them.”</blockquote><figcaption>— T&#39;Arris B. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Found my new go to barber in Fairfield. Chris and Christine are cool people, and all the barbers know what they’re doing. My first time I got a fresh fade from Christine. They take their time to give you the best cut for your money. Definitely recommend checking them out. Support your local Filipino shop!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Thomas A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Just got a cut from Chris and it was honestly one of the best I’ve had. He took his time, paid attention to every detail, and the fade came out super clean. The top was shaped perfectly, and you can tell he genuinely cares about his clients. He’s down to earth, easy to talk to, and really takes pride in what he does. If you’re looking for someone who doesn’t rush and delivers high-quality work, Chris is the one.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · May 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“C’s Barbershop is great. I get my haircut by Chris. He’s a stand up guy — a great barber and friend. Always offers good conversation and takes pride in his craft. I always leave the shop feeling good about myself. My friend also gets his haircut by Chris’ wife, and she is talented as well. Affordable prices and great company has me coming back as a regular!”</blockquote><figcaption>— James R. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“C&#39;s cuts has been my go-to place for almost 15 years for my hair cut needs. The environment is always great, and well-rounded barbers with steady hands are always hard to find, especially ones for such a great price. I truly recommend everybody to get their cuts, line ups, and fades at C&#39;s. You won&#39;t regret how great you look and feel afterward”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Chris and Christine takes their time to cut my hair. They are both very skilled barbers. Highly recommended if you want a nice clean and sharp looking haircut. Hint: go to either Chris and Christine first for your first time haircut.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Alexander C. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I’ve been coming to this place for a couple years now, and they’ve always been really kind and understanding. Before finding this place I had a really rough time finding someone who could cut my hair the way I like it, and by my surprise I found it down the street from me. 100/100 I’d recommend this place, and if you’re into a more chilled out vibe this is the place.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Aug 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I have two young boys and I can be very picky on who cuts their hair. I tend to have the usual people cut their hair but unfortunately none of them were available. I decided to go where my nephew always goes, C’s Barbershop. Let me just say that I’m very impressed !! Shoutout to the talented female who cut their hair! I wish I knew her name! I will definitely be bringing them back to her :)”</blockquote><figcaption>— Jeanette A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">الأسئلة الشائعة</p><h2>إجابات أسئلتكم</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>هل أحتاج إلى موعد؟</summary><p>لا، ادخل مباشرة. وإذا كنت تفضّل موعدًا أو تريد معرفة مدة الانتظار، اتصل بنا على ‎(707) 673-7601.</p></details><details><summary>هل تقبلون بطاقات الائتمان؟</summary><p>لا نقبل بطاقات الائتمان. نقبل الدفع نقدًا أو عبر Zelle.</p></details><details><summary>ما هي مواعيد العمل؟</summary><p>نفتح من الاثنين إلى السبت من 10 صباحًا حتى 5 مساءً، ونغلق يوم الأحد. قد تتغير المواعيد، لذا اتصل قبل المجيء.</p></details><details><summary>أين أركن سيارتي؟</summary><p>لدينا موقف سيارات خاص ومدخلان، واحد في الأمام وآخر في الخلف.</p></details><details><summary>هل تقصّون شعر الأطفال؟</summary><p>نعم! كثير من الأهل يحضرون أبناءهم.</p></details><details><summary>منذ متى والصالون مفتوح؟</summary><p>نحن مفتوحون منذ 2010.</p></details><details><summary>هل الصالون مهيّأ للكراسي المتحركة؟</summary><p>نعم، الصالون مهيّأ للكراسي المتحركة.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">زورونا</p>\n      <h2>المواعيد والموقع</h2>\n      <address>2240 N Texas St<br>Fairfield, CA 94533</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\">(707) 673-7601</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>الاثنين</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>الثلاثاء</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>الأربعاء</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>الخميس</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>الجمعة</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>السبت</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>الأحد</td><td>مغلق</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">قد تتغير المواعيد، لذا اتصل بنا للتأكد.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google reviews</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Yelp</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> اتصل</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=C&#39;s%20Cuts%2C%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%2C%20Fairfield%2C%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> احصل على الاتجاهات</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"map\">\n      <iframe title=\"خريطة الوصول إلى C&#39;s Cuts\" src=\"https://www.google.com/maps?q=C&#39;s%20Cuts%2C%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%2C%20Fairfield%2C%20CA%2094533&amp;output=embed\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"f